    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:4b5ff9b4a37f43cc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "a5aa717a8e122c7abd6c8304b7b35f94425296b448042ce4961bed64a0176fa0",
      "text": "Day 3 · After breakfast at the hotel, depart for a full-day excursion to the Atacama Salt Flats, high-altitude lagoons, and Socaire. Visit the high-altitude lagoons of Miscanti and Miñiques, located in the breathtaking Andean landscape. Lunch will be served in Socaire, a village located approximately 100 km southeast of San Pedro de Atacama. Continue to the Atacama Salt Flat (Salar de Atacama), where you will visit Chaxa Lagoon and the Flamingo National Reserve. Here, you will have the opportunity to observe three of the six different flamingo species found in the world.\n\nThe journey continues to the town of Toconao, where you will visit the Church of San Lucas and the Campanario Bell Tower. Return to San Pedro de Atacama.\n\nIncluded: Full-day group excursion · Entrance fees to Chaxa Lagoon and the high-altitude lagoons · Lunch · Breakfast",
      "provenance": {
